aren't as good as it as we might think.

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:35.220
In fact, when you multitask research
suggests that you're dividing your

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:40.200
brain's resources and attention,
resulting in less efficient work. Sure

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:45.330
you can do it but not to the same degree
