00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:49.589
one by one. So if you're trying to become
an intuitive eater, you really need to

00:12:49.589 --> 00:12:53.370
invest the time and effort into doing it.
Start by limiting distractions around

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:59.070
you. So turn the TV off, put your work
away, really focus on the act of eating

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:02.880
in a distraction-free environment. If you
