00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.770
You might be surprised how much more flavorful and

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:26.600
enjoyable food is when you've got your
full attention on it.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:32.100
Number two - reinforce your conscious
decision to stop. It's easy to tell

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:37.080
