listened to your hunger and fullness cues,
and yet again here you are hungry.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:16.170
It's important to keep in mind that there are
a lot of factors that can affect our

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:20.130
fullness. They're both biological and
